      "source": "will never be null.",
      "translation": "永远不会为 null。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>type</code> - the owning type, must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>type</code> - 拥有该类型的对象，不能为 null。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>Property</code></a> backed by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Field.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Field</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个由给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Field.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.lang.reflect\"><code>Field</code></a>和<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a>支持的新的<a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 中的类\"><code>Property</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a> is supported in for standalone creation of a <a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>Property</code></a>\ninstance.",
      "translation": "返回给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"java.beans 中的类或接口\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a>是否支持独立创建<a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 中的类\"><code>Property</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>Property</code></a> backed by the given field.",
      "translation": "根据给定的字段创建一个新的由该字段支持的<a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 包中的类\"><code>Property</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the field of the property if available and if its first (only) parameter matches the type of the property.",
      "translation": "如果可用且其第一个（也是唯一一个）参数与属性的类型匹配，则返回该属性的字段。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the getter of the property if available and if it matches the type of the property.",
      "translation": "如果可用且与属性类型匹配，则返回该属性的 getter。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the name of the property.",
      "translation": "返回属性的名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the setter of the property if available and if its first (only) parameter matches the type of the property.",
      "translation": "如果可用且其第一个（也是唯一一个）参数与属性的类型匹配，则返回该属性的设置器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type of the property.",
      "translation": "返回属性的类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the wither of the property if available and if its first (only) parameter matches the type of the property.",
      "translation": "如果可用且其第一个（也是唯一一个）参数与属性的类型匹配，则返回该属性的 wither。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the property exposes a getter or a setter.",
      "translation": "返回该属性是否公开了 getter 或 setter。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the property is backed by a field.",
      "translation": "返回该属性是否由字段支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>field</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>field</code> 不能为空。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>descriptor</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>descriptor</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
