    {
      "source": "Value object to abstract the concept of a property backed by a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Field.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Field</code></a> and / or a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "值对象用于抽象由 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Field.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Field</code></a> 和/或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"java.beans 中的类或接口\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a> 支持的属性概念。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>Property</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping.model 中的类\"><code>Property</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>Property</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a>. The creation might fail if the given\nproperty is not representing a proper property.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.desktop/java/beans/PropertyDescriptor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.beans\"><code>PropertyDescriptor</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"Property.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>Property</code></a>。如果给定的属性不代表一个有效的属性，则创建可能会失败。",
      "count": 1
    },
